flowchart TD
  Read[Read state + goal] --> Inspect[Inspect existing code]
  Inspect --> Plan[Create implementation plan]
  Plan --> Build[Implement smallest coherent slice]
  Build --> Verify[Run tests / typecheck / build]
  Verify --> Review[Self-review: QA + Security + UX + Architecture]
  Review --> Decision{Pass?}
  Decision -- No --> Fix[Fix defects]
  Fix --> Verify
  Decision -- Yes --> Record[Update state / checklist / decisions]
  Record --> Next{Goals remaining?}
  Next -- Yes --> Read
  Next -- No --> Final[Final readiness review]
